msgid "Any UART may be re-tasked by changing its protocol parameter."
msgstr "任何 UART 均可通过更改其协议参数重新分配用途。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:170
#: 98f069df4b534422ae2477170b8de26a
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "遥控输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:172
#: 09a6ab8c9183451d9b53740301b98aeb
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the R2 (UART2_RX) pin. It supports all RC "
"protocols except PPM and SBUS. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for "
"a specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` is set to "
"\"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""
"遥控输入配置在R2（UART2_RX）引脚上，支持除PPM和SBUS外的所有遥控协议。特定遥控系统的详细信息请参见 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。:ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 默认设置为「23」以启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:174
#: e6330f3a57304621af1a69feb86e9c08
msgid ""
"SBUS connects to the SBUS pad which inverts the input and applies it to to "
"R2 input."
msgstr "SBUS连接到SBUS焊盘，经反相后接入R2输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:176
#: 450214a1efaf414abb346c761fa23e14
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T2 and :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` "
"be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort需连接T2，且须将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:178
#: 0fe503eb48e74ea3af6b5e49ac861ba8
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T2 connection, in addition to R2, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF除需连接R2外，还需连接T2，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 "
"「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:180
#: d441be958d344ddbb2d896113fe24683
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connecton to T2 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set "
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr "SRXL2需连接T2，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:182
#: 09e731f1cb9f45f7aa300cfa0962e50e
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:185
#: 35208052ab694768a6d971721a648435
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:187
#: f8a409ec1c564337b552c34d2276835c
msgid ""
"The FoxeerF405v2  supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver). The defaults are also setup to allow DJI Goggle OSD support on "
"UART4. Both the internal analog OSD and the DisplayPort OSD can be used "
"simultaneously by setting :ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` = 5"
msgstr ""
"FoxeerF405v2支持使用 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` "
"1（MAX7456驱动）的OSD。默认也已配置为支持UART4上的DJI护目镜OSD。通过设置 :ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` "
"= 5，可同时使用内部模拟OSD和DisplayPort OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:190
#: c919131b1fd84f1c9de8175e10b9a8ad
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:192
#: 0e11636480824f998324e1cc725da739
msgid ""
"The FoxeerF405v2 supports up to 10 PWM outputs (PWM 9  is defaulted to "
"serial LED support). Outputs are available via two JST-SH connectors. All "
"outputs support DShot,as well as all PWM types."
msgstr ""
"FoxeerF405v2最多支持10路PWM输出（PWM9默认用于串行LED支持）。输出通过两个JST-"
"SH连接器提供。所有输出均支持DShot及所有PWM类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:194
#: bb660d8cbcd141c8b01c54c24a2395f5
msgid "The PWM is in 3 groups:"
msgstr "PWM分为3组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:196
#: 635d755f11a6476ea5bf8da86a2be39e
msgid "PWM 1, 4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、4为第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:197
#: 21d93e458b544141a27a130ff1367f2a
msgid "PWM 2, 3 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 2、3为第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:198
#: 854056abbd2749a4898755b302fb2ff7
msgid "PWM 6-8  in group3"
msgstr "PWM 6-8为第3组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:199
#: e1c5dd4be3744e57ac5fe31da3c36834
msgid "PWM 5, 9 (LED) in group4"
msgstr "PWM 5、9（LED）为第4组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:200
#: be45d3d252924fef919b66485bb78032
msgid "PWM 10 in group5"
msgstr "PWM 10为第5组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:202
#: b5edfb587aed4412b3bdeb73e1edfff6
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate, whether PWM"
" or Dshot. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr ""
"同一组内的通道无论使用 PWM 还是 DShot 都必须使用相同的输出频率。若组内任一通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:206
#: 0721c78d03da45e3be559a95707ef404
msgid ""
"by default PWM9 is configured as an LED output, making PWM5 only usable as a"
" serial LED also. You can re-assign PWM9's function to something else if you"
" wish to use PWM5 normally."
msgstr "默认情况下PWM9配置为LED输出，这使得PWM5也只能用作串行LED。若要正常使用PWM5，可将PWM9的功能重新分配为其他用途。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:208
#: 9c3b262f8ff34cd78c14f35355663bb2
msgid ""
"for users migrating from BetaflightX quads, the first four outputs M1-M4 "
"have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default "
"parameters:"
msgstr "对于从BetaflightX机架迁移的用户，前四路输出M1-M4已配置为使用现有电机接线，默认参数如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:210
#: cd92c142feeb4914952730303313ac8f
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1（四旋翼）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:211
#: 19f6a2dfdcc842cfb398e2018dd99407
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12（BetaFlightX）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:214
#: 3bf21231bc5e413d9db998ba4807f86f
msgid "GPIO and Camera Switch"
msgstr "GPIO和相机切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:216
#: 54f8ce2e96234ee6b210051be3428790
msgid ""
"GPIO pin 70 is the SER pad and is assigned by default to RELAY2 "
"functionality. This pin can be controlled via GCS or by RC transmitter using"
" the :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions` feature."
msgstr ""
"GPIO引脚70为SER焊盘，默认分配为RELAY2功能。此引脚可通过地面站或遥控发射机使用 :ref:`common-auxiliary-"
"functions` 功能进行控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:218
#: 701a150f44104d40a5ccf2dcc5087c63
msgid ""
"Camera input can be switched between CAM1 input and CA2 input using GPIO 71 "
"which is assigned by default to the RELAY3 functionality. It can be "
"controlled like the GPIO above."
msgstr "相机输入可通过GPIO 71在CAM1输入和CA2输入之间切换，GPIO 71默认分配为RELAY3功能。控制方式与上述GPIO相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:221
#: 0ca67bd06c58419e92622e027b070ab5
msgid "LED Output"
msgstr "LED输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:223
#: c94105b0298346e09a3a8f34ed6f6ad8
msgid ""
"The LED output is configured by default to support :ref:`NeoPixel LED "
"strings<common-serial-led-neopixel>`."
msgstr "LED 输出默认配置为支持 :ref:`NeoPixel LED 灯带<common-serial-led-neopixel>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:226
#: 1e034c3652bf4e0684c0327c150440c4
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:228
#: c3abd88d7f654da0bcb8b13e905af39d
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor via the B+ pin, but no internal "
"current sensor. An external current sensor can be connected to the CUR pin. "
"Default parameters for both internal voltage and external current monitoring"
" are set by default to the below for use with any Holybro Tekko32 F4 4in1 "
"ESC."
msgstr ""
"该板通过 B+ 引脚内置电压传感器，但无内部电流传感器。外部电流传感器可连接到 CUR 引脚。内部电压和外部电流监测的默认参数已针对 Holybro "
"Tekko32 F4 4合1 ESC 进行预设。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:230
#: 450a9bebd3004c439462116a385bf30d
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr "正确的电池设置参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:232
#: d4783281b5d04e41a07c95f87afafdb7
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:233
#: e4956e5ce2dd4d8da3063c480e0242de
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:234
#: 315e7b07abd04eb0b43f4bf48dd9c4c2
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:235
#: e626026895a94a778760a5d01a81db26
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:236
#: af467a19ac7544989f4c87d700fff273
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 142 but "
"varies depending on external current sensor"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"142，但因外部电流传感器不同而有所差异"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:239
#: 671c979f56c541dda5317907536b8e4c
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:241
#: f50175cff78b44c9823d584d06019c27
msgid ""
"The FoxeerF405v2 does not have a built-in compass, however you can attach an"
" external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "FoxeerF405v2没有内置罗盘，但可通过SDA和SCL焊盘的I2C连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:244
#: 9bf831f384c04407b6ccbb234a0e9aeb
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:246
#: e001486db53a42fb86760282389ff0c2
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"FoxeerF405v2\"."
msgstr ""
"此飞控板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 的「FoxeerF405v2」子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:249
#: 9939368f4d99415398a4360bf4c49f1c
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:251
#: 55d0b3d0043943fdad0ec9b5264f7514
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入USB以DFU方式完成。然后使用您喜欢的DFU加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:255
#: cf92fb5c640146bfb12d876ad562e55f
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Later updates should be done with the "
"\\*.apj firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任意ArduPilot地面站软件更新固件。后续更新请使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
